    "detailed_description": "Make your dream come true and excperince the wonders of owning your own resturant. Or why not two, why not three or even four?<br><br>Kitchen Carnage is a single player simulation game. You get to own your own resturants and managing them all at the same time all alone. The different restuarants layouts, customer orders and food combinations will always keep you stressed and on your feet. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853270/extras/f2d72c65d94f5b7ce43af5ed994ac5a2.poster.avif?t=1714138695\" width=258 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853270/extras/f2d72c65d94f5b7ce43af5ed994ac5a2.webm?t=1714138695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853270/extras/f2d72c65d94f5b7ce43af5ed994ac5a2.mp4?t=1714138695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But fear not! With a steady hand and a knack for multitasking, you'll navigate through the ups and downs of running a restaurant. Each level in Kitchen Carnage presents a fresh set of obstacles, from changing environments to a rotating menu of dishes.<br><br>So, get ready to roll up your sleeves and tackle the chaos of Kitchen Carnage head-on! With quick thinking and adaptability, you'll conquer every twist and turn in this exciting culinary journey.",
    "about_the_game": "Make your dream come true and excperince the wonders of owning your own resturant. Or why not two, why not three or even four?<br><br>Kitchen Carnage is a single player simulation game. You get to own your own resturants and managing them all at the same time all alone. The different restuarants layouts, customer orders and food combinations will always keep you stressed and on your feet. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853270/extras/f2d72c65d94f5b7ce43af5ed994ac5a2.poster.avif?t=1714138695\" width=258 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853270/extras/f2d72c65d94f5b7ce43af5ed994ac5a2.webm?t=1714138695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2853270/extras/f2d72c65d94f5b7ce43af5ed994ac5a2.mp4?t=1714138695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But fear not! With a steady hand and a knack for multitasking, you'll navigate through the ups and downs of running a restaurant. Each level in Kitchen Carnage presents a fresh set of obstacles, from changing environments to a rotating menu of dishes.<br><br>So, get ready to roll up your sleeves and tackle the chaos of Kitchen Carnage head-on! With quick thinking and adaptability, you'll conquer every twist and turn in this exciting culinary journey.",
